# Verify before finishing

Before saying a code change is done, run:

- `yarn test:typecheck` — TypeScript (tsc).
- `yarn test:code` — ESLint. CI runs with `--max-warnings=0`, so warnings fail too.

Fix whatever they report. `yarn fix` auto-resolves most formatting/lint issues.
For behavior changes, also run the relevant `yarn test` and update snapshots with
`yarn test:update` when the change is intentional.
